🔥 Redux Important Concepts
1. Redux

Redux enna?
Redux oru state management library. Application-la multiple components share panra data-va centralized-ah manage panna use panrom.

Yen use panrom?
Oru data-va many components use panna vendi irundha, props-la repeated-ah pass pannama easy-ah manage panna Redux use panrom.

2. State

State enna?
State na application-oda current data/value.

Yen use panrom?
Application-la change aagura data-va store panni manage panna state use panrom.

Example:
Cart items, username, product quantity.

3. Store

Store enna?
Store na Redux-oda central place, inga application-oda Redux state store aagum.

Yen use panrom?
Different components same data-va access panna oru common place venum. Adhuku store use panrom.

4. Slice

Slice enna?
Slice na application-oda oru particular feature-oda state and related logic.

Yen use panrom?
Application data-va feature-wise organize panna slice use panrom.

Example:

cartSlice
userSlice
productSlice

Cart-ku related data → cartSlice
User-ku related data → userSlice

5. Reducer

Reducer enna?
Reducer na state epdi change aaganum-nu define panra function.

Yen use panrom?
User oru action perform pannumbodhu state-la enna change pannanum-nu define panna reducer use panrom.

Example:

addToCart
removeItem
increaseQty
decreaseQty
6. Action

Action enna?
Action na enna operation panna vendum-nu Redux-ku sollura instruction/message.

Yen use panrom?
Redux-la endha operation trigger pannanum-nu identify panna action use panrom.

Example:

addToCart
removeItem
clearCart
7. Payload

Payload enna?
Payload na action-kooda send panra actual data.

Yen use panrom?
Reducer-ku state update panna required-aana data-va anuppa payload use panrom.

Example:

dispatch(removeItem(5));

Inga 5 dhaan payload.

Meaning:

"ID 5 irukkura product-ah remove pannu."

8. Dispatch

Dispatch enna?
Dispatch na action-ah Redux-ku send/trigger panra method.

Yen use panrom?
Component-la irundhu Redux state change panna action-ah trigger panna dispatch use panrom.

Example:

dispatch(addToCart(product));

Meaning:

"Redux, indha product-ah cart-la add pannu."

9. useSelector

useSelector enna?
useSelector na Redux Store-la irukkura data-va read/get panna use panra hook.

Yen use panrom?
Component-ku Redux-la irukkura data venumna, adha access panna useSelector use panrom.

Example:

const cart = useSelector(state => state.cart.cart);
10. useDispatch

useDispatch enna?
useDispatch na dispatch function-ah component-kulla use panna help panra hook.

Yen use panrom?
Component-lendhu Redux action-ah trigger panna useDispatch use panrom.

Example:

const dispatch = useDispatch();

dispatch(addToCart(product));
11. createSlice

createSlice enna?
createSlice na Redux Toolkit-la oru slice create panna use panra function.

Yen use panrom?
State, reducers, actions-ah separate-separate-ah write pannama ore place-la organize panna use panrom.

12. configureStore

configureStore enna?
configureStore na Redux Store create and configure panna use panra function.

Yen use panrom?
Namma reducers-ah connect panni, application-ku Redux Store setup panna use panrom.

13. Provider

Provider enna?
Provider na Redux Store-ah React application full-ah available panna use panra component.

Yen use panrom?
Header, Home, Cart, Checkout maari different components Redux Store-ah access panna Provider use panrom.

14. Redux Toolkit

Redux Toolkit enna?
Redux Toolkit na Redux code-ah easy-ah and less code-la write panna official toolkit.

Yen use panrom?
Normal Redux-la adhigama boilerplate code irukkum. Redux Toolkit use pannina code simple and clean-ah irukkum.